# Multi-agent file ownership

Multiple agents must **never replace** each other's files. Extends the one-owner idea in `admin-ownership.mdc` (admin team/usage/invite). Do not vendor or delete other rules.

## Wait, then merge

Before editing a file another agent may be writing: **WAIT** until that agent finishes, re-read the file, then apply only your delta. If two tasks touch the same file, serialize. Never wholesale-rewrite a shared file to "fix conflicts."

```text
# ❌ BAD — clobber a file another agent just wrote
rewrite SharedFile.tsx from scratch to resolve a merge

# ✅ GOOD — wait, re-read, apply only your delta
# 1. Wait until the other agent finishes
# 2. Re-read SharedFile.tsx
# 3. Patch only the lines your task needs
```

## One owner per overlapping area

Prefer **one owner** per change set. Do not split the same file across parallel agents.

- **Studio/admin chrome:** `components/app/studio/*`, dashboard and admin pages. Shared chrome (`StudioShell`, `AppHeader`, `PageTabs`) is the studio owner's file; other screens import it.
- **App sidebar / workspace:** `components/layout/Sidebar`, `components/workspace/*`.
- **Auth/home:** login, `AuthModal`, public home, register.
- **Projects backend:** Prisma `Project`, `lib/projects`, `/api/projects`.
- **Plan/Build + stacks:** `lib/projects/plan`, `/api/projects/[id]/plan`, `lib/stacks`.
- **Visual Edits:** `lib/visual-edits`, workspace preview toolbar.
- **Checkpoints:** `lib/checkpoints`, `/api/projects/[id]/checkpoints`, thin/purge crons. Object snapshots via `readSnapshot`/`writeSnapshot`. Merge into sandbox restore; do not rewrite `ensureSandbox`.
- **Sandbox lifecycle:** `lib/sandbox/manager.ts`, `/api/projects/[id]/sandbox`, `/api/cron/reap-sandboxes`. All VM create goes through `ensureSandbox`. Do not call E2B `Sandbox.create` outside `lib/sandbox/`.
- **SEO audit:** `lib/seo`, `lib/stack-prompts/seo-rules.ts`, `/api/projects/[id]/seo`, workspace Quality → SEO & AI search.
- **Code quality audit:** `lib/audit`, `/api/projects/[id]/audit`, workspace Quality → Code & performance. Reuse the SEO fix pipeline; do not fork a second generation path.
- **Connectors / GitHub:** `app/(app)/connectors`, `lib/github`, `/api/github`.
- **Generation engine:** `lib/generation`, `generate-ai-code-stream`, `apply-ai-code-stream`.
- **URL import:** `lib/import`, Prisma `ImportSource`, `/api/projects/[id]/import`. Merge TopBar with a source-URL link only; do not rewrite SEO/Assets tabs.
- **Workspace Skills:** `lib/skills`, `/settings/skills`, Prisma `Skill`. Conditional inject after the cacheable prefix. Do not fold into Brain memory.
- **Brain memory:** `lib/memory`, Prisma `MemoryEntry`, workspace Brain tab. Always-on; inside the cacheable prefix. Do not put skill content in the memory block.
- **Quality measurement:** `lib/signals`, `lib/prompts/version.ts`, `/admin/quality`. Merge hooks only into audits/checkpoints/persist. Do not auto-change prompts.
- **Coolify deploy settings:** `lib/coolify`, `/admin/deploy`, `/api/admin/deploy`. Encrypted token in `AppSetting`; env wins. Do not write tokens into source.
